{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first time I heard music by Sean Bialo, also known as CosmicGem, I was immediately drawn in by its creative playfulness and distinctive charm. Even years later, I still consider him one of the most talented composers in the gaming industry.<br><br>While Sean has since created fantastic music for many titles, his work on <i>Donut Dodo</i> stands out as, in my opinion, some of his very best.<br><br>This chiptune treat includes 9 whimsical tracks and jingles, available in both high-quality MP3 and uncompressed WAV formats.<br><br>Enjoy!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711500?t=1751877731","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711500?t=1751877731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711500/5db48b20c1421d391b78e02de9e19d19db426550/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751877731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711500/5db48b20c1421d391b78e02de9e19d19db426550/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751877731","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first time I heard music by Sean Bialo, also known as CosmicGem, I was immediately drawn in by its creative playfulness and distinctive charm. Even years later, I still consider him one of the most talented composers in the gaming industry.<br><br>While Sean has since created fantastic music for many titles, his work on <i>Donut Dodo</i> stands out as, in my opinion, some of his very best.<br><br>This chiptune treat includes 9 whimsical tracks and jingles, available in both high-quality MP3 and uncompressed WAV formats.<br><br>Enjoy!</p>","developers":["pixel games SARL-S"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1779560","name":"Donut Dodo"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711500/dbbf49fd9048e7268ee82dc5032ec53660c